OL,3,APoundland's future hangs in the balance
OL,4,Aas chain edges towards collapse
OL,5,
OL,6,FPoundland's future is hanging in the
OL,7,Fbalance as the discount chain edges
OL,8,Ftowards collapse.
OL,10,FThe retailer's bosses have filed a
OL,11,Fnotice of intention to appoint
OL,12,Fadministrators which will give the
OL,13,Fbusiness 10 days to find a rescue deal.
OL,15,FThe move comes after managing director
OL,16,FBarry Williams told its 12,000 staff
OL,17,Fthe chain's US owner had cut off a
OL,18,Fvital supply of funding despite
OL,19,FPoundland's strong sales.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,0,100
