OL,3,APoundland's future hangs in the balance
OL,4,Aas chain edges towards collapse
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is understood the firm's owner,
OL,7,FGordon Brothers, wants to break it up,
OL,8,Fwith rivals Poundstretcher, B&M and
OL,9,FLidl interested in potentially buying
OL,10,Fup its stores.
